#902
"Garnie Lane"
"This small lane was named after Chiiron's local hero, Garnie.  A small plaque

affixed to the side of the Trader's Shop to the west bears an inscription in

his honor.  To the south can be seen the green of the Village Square, and the

faint sound of the fountain in the center of town can be heard.  Further to

the north, the massive northern gates of the city can be seen, rising out of

local grey stone.

"
