"sign brass plaque stone marker"
"The small brass plaque mounted on a grey stone marker to the side of the fountain reads:

@eBe welcome to Chiiron, and may the waters of this fountain slake your thirst.@n

@eRest, enjoy the water, watch the fish swim, and relax.@n

"
E
"fountain"
"Concentric basins of pale grey granite rise one above the other in a simple

and elegant design for the town's fountain.  Water rises forth from the

pinnacle of the piece, a full seven feet in the air, beginning its journey

down through the four catch-basins.  The stone is edged with small scallops,

giving the water a bit of turbulence to increase its song.

"
