#904
"Outside the Temple of Taranth"
"This verdant swath of green in front of the whitewashed temple to the south

seems to be a pleasant spot for the gatherings in Chiiron.  A small altar of

grey stone rests to the eastern side of the clearing, the remnants of several

offerings of flowers littering its surface.  The town square can be seen to

the north of here, as well as the roads and buildings continuing on.

"
