#906
"Trader Road"
"Trader Road continues to the east and west from here, from the Town Square and

further down to the West Gate of town that can be seen in the distance.  A

clean, whitewashed wooden building stands off the road to the north, while the

village tavern looms upon the south side.  The yard before the northern store

is neat and trimmed, while only a patch of bare earth between several shrubs

stand in the short distance between the bar and the thoroughfare.

