#907
"Trader Road"
"Trader Road leads east and west, the main thoroughfare through the village of

Chiiron.  Off the road to the north, a well-kept wooden building rests quietly

behind a functional garden trained into neat rows.  A sign swings by the door,

emblazoned with the image of a chest bound in iron.  A squat building to the

south is heralded by a swinging wooden sign, painted brightly with the image

of a red fox.

"
