#908
"East Gate of Chiiron"
"Before you stands the east gate of Chiiron.  It is a simple gate house between

two towers.  To the north is a staircase leading into one of the towers, and

to the side of the gate itself, is a @elever@n which looks like pushing it or

pulling it controls the portcullis.  Main Street runs west, and you can see

shops down that way on either side.  South is the town park.  East, the road

leads out of Chiiron and into dangers unknown.

"
