#909
"The Trading Post"
"The Trading Post of Chiiron is filled with sundry items neatly arranged on

shelves, in jars, and in cabinets.  The room is spotlessly clean and smells of

fresh pine oil and strong soap.  A thick carpet covers the wood floor, and

while clean, does show the wear of foot traffic between the door and the

counter.

