#910
"Fur Trader's Shop"
"Shelves line the walls of the main room of this squat building, neatly stacked

with furs and pelts of many kinds.  There is a bear rug before the fireplace,

and the furniture is all dark wood with thick, cured leather coverings.  Pelts

are scattered across the sofa and chair for both display purposes and for

their offering of warmth to a weary customer.

"
