"shelves oddities"
"Tall oak shelves cover the walls from ceiling to floor, cluttered with a

series of oddities...all manner of switches, gears and levers, and even a

smattering of toys' body parts...arranged it seems, more to suit the owner's

fancy than to draw the customer's eye.

