spiced oil used for cleaning.  Woven rugs adorn a floor of the same rich wood,

their bright patterns and colors undiminished by the travel of many pairs of

feet.  Thick beams support the high ceiling above, the white daub inlaid with

an intricate mosaic of Taranth, Patroness of Chiiron, and Kerog, God of War.

On one wall, someone has hung a wall calendar displaying today's date.

