#962
"Town Park"
"You are in the Chiiron town park.  Ancient oak and elm trees are scattered

across wide, grassy lawns.  Stone statues of fantastic, legendary creatures

surround a small pond, while other statuary seems to hide beneath the trees.

Peaceful winds rustle the leaves, and birdsong reaches you from all

directions.  The high town wall serves as the park's eastern border, while a

lower wall bounds the park to the west.  A narrow gravel path leads north from

here toward the main street of Chiiron.  A stone barrier to the south seems to

have collapsed recently.

