tables are arranged in an uneven pattern about the middle of the area.  A thin

veil of smoke hovers in the air here, for this is where locals come to discuss

recent events, and strangers to exchange coin and news of the dark and

sinister in low, hushed whispers.  A small @bsign@n adorns the wall beside a

dartboard.

