#985
"Beneath the Grocery Shop"
"An orderly storeroom for the grocery store's spare supplies, when there

actually spare supplies to store.  The room appears to be largely vacant right

now with a few empty crates stacked against one wall.  A set of stairs leads

up to a closed trap door and, from the look of the nails around its edge, it

appears as if someone has thoroughly nailed it shut.  Fortunately, a crack in

the ceiling just above a stack of crates looks like it might be wide enough to

squeeze through.  An even larger crevice sits in the eastern wall where a

section has crumbled away to reveal a tunnel heading east.

"
"climb/enter wall/crevice/ceiling to get into grocer's shop in Chiiron. 

