E
"trapdoor door trap stairs"
"The stairs leading up to the trap door appear to be in good condition although

are somewhat dusty from disuse.  The trap door has been nailed firmly shut as

evidenced by the tips of nails poking through the wood surrounding the door.

"
E
"1 east tunnel wall"
"The eastern wall, once nicely lined by wooden boards covered in plaster, now

has a gaping hole where something has chewed its way through into the

basement.  Beyond the basement appears to be a dry, sandy tunnel.

"
